opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "Kernel-checked real-root certificates for polynomials from rational coefficient enclosures"
description: """
The `qedroots` layer of a verified computational substrate for finite,
kernel-checkable polynomial certificates (chain: qedinterval -> qedpoly ->
qedroots -> qedanalytic -> qedjensen), extracted from the
NetTopologySuite.Proofs corpus.

  - `QedPoly`: coefficient-list polynomials over R and Q, synthetic
    division, the factor theorem from distinct roots, executable Q
    multiplication with its R transport.
  - `QedInterval`: exact rational enclosures of P(x) over a box of
    coefficient intervals, with a strict sign decision.
  - `QedRoots`: `hyperbolic` (multiset of real roots) and
    `simple_real_rooted` as separate predicates; a robust sign-alternation
    certificate (`cert_sound`: every REAL coefficient vector inside a
    rational box is simple-real-rooted) and a factor certificate with
    explicit multiplicities (`factor_cert_sound`).
  - `QedRootsExamples`: a self-reciprocal quintic certified with a +-1/20
    coefficient box, repeated-root instances, negative controls.

Certificates are booleans over Q decided by `vm_compute`; floating point
never enters.  Sound, deliberately not complete.  Stdlib only; uses the
three stdlib classical-reals axioms.

Provenance: github.com/MerkatorBV/NetTopologySuite.Proofs (assembled via
the package MANIFEST).
"""
maintainer: "Jeroen Bloemscheer <jeroen.bloemscheer@merkator.com>"
authors: ["NetTopologySuite.Proofs contributors"]
license: "BSD-3-Clause"
homepage: "https://github.com/MerkatorBV/NetTopologySuite.Proofs"
bug-reports: "https://github.com/MerkatorBV/NetTopologySuite.Proofs/issues"
dev-repo: "git+https://github.com/MerkatorBV/NetTopologySuite.Proofs.git"

depends: [
  "rocq-core" {>= "9.2" & < "9.3~"}
  "rocq-stdlib"
]

build: [
  [make "-j%{jobs}%"]
]
install: [
  [make "install"]
]

tags: [
  "category:Mathematics/Algebra"
  "keyword:polynomials"
  "keyword:real roots"
  "keyword:hyperbolic polynomials"
  "keyword:certificates"
  "keyword:interval arithmetic"
  "logpath:NTS.Proofs"
  "date:2026-11-20"
]
